    "SDSC 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 or 32 MiB, 512-byte sectors; no SDHC/SDXC, SDI DMA or electrical/cycle timing calibration.",
    "FIFO backpressure is functional and clocked; this is not a bit-level SD bus validation.",
    "Original-system evidence covers the admitted 49g+ and 48gII full NOR hashes only. HP50g remains core-profile coverage without its own stock full-NOR workflow.",
    "HP48gII has no slot and rejects card insertion; no artificial SD port is added to its board.",
    "The SRAM mirror is an explicit board preset assumption and is not generalized to every hardware revision.",
    "Browser UI/Worker/file-picker/IndexedDB lifecycle acceptance is recorded separately by the production-browser witness."
  ],
